  "text": "Holdings: The old man and the sea / :: National Virtual Union Catalogue - Sri Lanka Skip to content VuFind Login All Fields Title Author Subject Call Number ISBN/ISSN Tag Find Advanced The old man and the sea / Cite this Text this Email this Print Export Record Export to RefWorks Export to EndNoteWeb Export to EndNote Export to MARC Export to BibTeX Export to RIS Save to List Permanent link The old man and the sea / Ernest Hemingway Saved in: Bibliographic Details Main Author: Hemingway, Ernest Format: Book Language: English Published: Colombo : Sadeepa, 2017. Tags: Add Tag No Tags, Be the first to tag this record! Holdings Description Comments Similar Items Staff View System Under Maintenance Our Library Management System is currently under maintenance. Holdings and item availability information is currently unavailable. Please accept our apologies for any inconvenience this may cause and contact us for further assistance: ravikumarmn@esn.ac.lk Similar Items The Old man and the Sea by: Hemingway, Ernest Published: (2000) The Old Man And The Sea / by: Hemingway, Ernest Published: (1952) The old man and the sea by: Hemingway, Ernest Published: (1958) The Old Man and The Sea. by: Hemingway, Ernest Published: (1977) The Old Man and The Sea. by: Hemingway, Ernest Published: (1977) About National Virtual Union Catalogue The National Virtual Union Catalogue of Sri Lanka serves as a centralized portal, enabling users to search and browse bibliographic records from libraries across the country. Currently, it integrates the catalogues of 25 public libraries, alongside the National Library of Sri Lanka. Through this platform, users can conveniently search for specific book details and determine their availability in participating libraries. Furthermore, the site offers real-time updates on the status of books, ensuring accurate and timely information for its users. The NLDSB invites all libraries to become part of the Virtual Union Catalogue (VUC), a platform designed to benefit the entire nation. Following libraries are currently incorporated into the VUC. Libraries interested in joining the VUC are encouraged to contact the Bibliographic Control Division of the NLDSB for further details. Ampara public library Ambalangoda public library Badulla public library Batticaloa public library Bibile public library Diyathilaka public library Doulwa public library Galewela public library Horana public library Hakmana public library Hambantota public library Kirimetiyana public library Kurunegala public library Mannar public library National Library Nochchiyagama public library Opanayake public library Polonnaruwa public library Point Pedro public library Puthukkudiyiruppu public library Ruwanwella public library Uppuveli public library Vaddakachchi public library Vengalacheddikulam public library Veyangoda public library Browse the Catalog Browse Alphabetically Explore Channels Search Tips Request to join Copyright © 2023, National Library & Documentation Services Board No 14, Independence Avenue Colombo 07, Sri Lanka Phone: +94112698847/ +94112685197 | Fax: +94112685201 | Email: biblio@mail.natlib.lk | Web: www.natlib.lk",
